Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanae...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eski alışkanlığımdan kurtulamıyorum. {that's not lady-like, sanae. re-activate your yamato nadeshiko mode renai circulation!}
